    },
    "summary": "An automatic success, pass, hit or wound skips the roll: carry on to the sequence’s following step as if the needed result came up, but rules that trigger on a particular result don’t apply.\n\nSo an automatic **hit roll** is never a **critical hit**, nor an automatic **wound roll** a **critical wound**.",
